<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">A LITTLE EVERY DAY</text><view class="title">每天，记牢一点。</view><view class="study-metrics card"><view><text class="metric">{{stats.today.new || 0}}</text><text>今日新词</text></view><view><text class="metric">{{stats.today.review || 0}}</text><text>今日复习</text></view><view><text class="metric">{{stats.streak}}</text><text>连续学习天数</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{stats.pending}}" class="info row"><text>有未完成的学习进度</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onContinue">继续学习</button></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">选择词表</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onCreate">导入词表</button></view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{decks}}" wx:key="id" class="deck-row"><button class="deck-select {{deck === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onDeck"><text class="word">{{item.name}}</text><text class="meaning">{{item.count}} 个单词 / 短语</text></button><button class="text-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onWordlist">查看</button></view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">练习方式</text></view><view class="chips"><button class="chip {{mode === 'flash' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="flash" bindtap="onMode">词卡回忆</button><button class="chip {{mode === 'spell' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="spell" bindtap="onMode">单词拼写</button><button class="chip {{mode === 'choice' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="choice" bindtap="onMode">选义练习</button></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary start-study" bindtap="onStart">开始学习</button><button bindtap="onPlayer">单词连续播放</button></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">学习计划</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onSavePlan">保存</button></view><view class="card plan-card"><view class="row"><text>每日新词</text><input type="number" value="{{dailyNew}}" bindinput="onNew" maxlength="3"/></view><view class="row"><text>每日复习</text><input type="number" value="{{dailyReview}}" bindinput="onReview" maxlength="3"/></view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">最近七天</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onMastered">熟词管理</button><text class="small muted">已学 {{stats.learned}} · 掌握 {{stats.mastered}}</text></view><view class="card week-chart"><view wx:for="{{stats.days}}" wx:key="date" class="day-bar"><text>{{item.count}}</text><view style="height:{{item.count > 100 ? 100 : item.count + 3}}px"></view><text>{{item.date}}</text></view></view><view class="footer">根据“忘记 / 困难 / 记住 / 熟练”安排下次复习。统计只计算已提交的学习卡片，重复点击不会重复计数。</view></view>
